      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems a little odd to me to store the actions in the fixture, since their useful lifetime is entirely within the lifetime of a single test. Does k_fifo_put not copy the item into the fifo structure? Even if it did, wouldn\u0027t a local variable outlive the fifo element in this test?",
